<% 
/*
 * Meter "High demand alert" email 
 * 
 * This email is sent to each user selected in the "Distribute to:" dropdown when the alert is first created.
 *
 * Available data:
 * + user (the user that the email is being sent to, see api/models/User.js for attributes)
 * + project (the project containing the meter that triggered the alert, see api/models/Project.js for attributes)
 * + alertGroup (the alert group that this alert is under, which contains the alert parameters.  See api/models/MeterAlertGroup.js for attributes)
 * + meter (the meter that triggered the alert event, see api/models/Meter.js for attributes)
 *
 */
%>


<p>Hi <%= user.firstName %>,</p>

<p>This message is to report that a meter in the <%=project.name%> facility is reporting high demand.</p>

<p>The meter <strong><%=meter.name%></strong> has measured demand above <%=alertGroup.threshold%> KW for over <%=alertGroup.delay%> minutes.</p>

<p>You will not receive another email about this alert for the next 24 hours.</p>

<% var brandName = typeof brandName !== 'undefined' ? brandName : 'Xeco'; %>
<p>
  You&rsquo;re welcome,<br/>
  The <%= brandName %> Team
</p>
